		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>ne pas faire :</p><div class="codebox"><pre><code>madatabase# &quot;select count (*) from table-toto&quot;</code></pre></div><p>mais</p><div class="codebox"><pre><code>madatabase# select count (*) from table-toto;</code></pre></div>]]></content>
